## 🎯 Test Scenarios for v6.6

### Scenario 1: View Credential Packets Dashboard
1. Land on Organization Dashboard
2. Review the packets list
3. Notice status badges (Opened, Received, Pending)
4. Find the empty packet (Dr. Michael Chen)

### Scenario 2: Create a Packet for a Practitioner
1. Click Settings icon in sidebar
2. Go to "Manage Practitioners" tab
3. Find a practitioner without a packet (Emily Williams or Robert Martinez)
4. Click the send icon (📤) to create packet
5. Confirm in the modal
6. Land on Empty Packet view

### Scenario 3: Upload a Credential
1. From Empty Packet view, click "Upload Credential"
2. Drop or select a file
3. Watch OCR processing
4. Review extracted data
5. Click "Done"

### Scenario 4: Open an Existing Packet
1. From Dashboard, click "Open Packet" on Dr. Leah Houston
2. Review the full packet detail view (existing functionality)
3. Verify credentials, view proof, etc.

